                {
                    "row": 0,
                    "col": 0,
                    "text": "2. The following was identified as a result of the inspection:",
                    "gridspan": 5,
                    "vmerge": null,
                    "is_header": true,
                    "anchor": null
                },
                {
                    "row": 1,
                    "col": 0,
                    "text": "2.1 Remarks on the accompanying documentation (none, or give comments): During the review of the technical documentation, a violation of Section 5 of the Technical Specifications of the Supply Contract was identified: the Material Safety Data Sheet (MSDS) was not provided. Additionally, an incorrect English translation of the Declaration of Conformity was submitted, containing text in Russian. /В ходе проверки технической документации выявлено нарушение раздела 5 Технического задания Договора поставки - не предоставлен паспорт безопасности (MSDS). Также предоставлен некорректный перевод на английский язык Декларации о соответствии, содержащий текст на русском языке.",
                    "gridspan": 5,
                    "vmerge": null,
                    "is_header": false,
                    "anchor": null
                },
                {
                    "row": 2,
                    "col": 0,
                    "text": "2.2. Remarks for visual, measurement and other inspections including Materials completeness (none, or give comments): NONE",
